$$
\boldsymbol {\Sigma} _ {b ^ {\prime}} = \boldsymbol {\Sigma} _ {p} - \mathbf {K} \boldsymbol {\Sigma} _ {o} \mathbf {K} ^ {\top}
$$

$$
